WEBVTT

00:05.470 --> 00:06.810
Just wait, Touka.

00:07.490 --> 00:09.990
We're going to fix this world.

00:10.450 --> 00:11.480
I promise.

00:11.990 --> 00:17.000
Episode 6
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama

00:12.280 --> 00:14.440
We know we are not worthy

00:14.440 --> 00:17.000
O great Lord Mitama

00:17.400 --> 00:19.750
A toast, to celebrate 
being free of the Empire!

00:19.750 --> 00:22.040
Cheers!

00:22.280 --> 00:24.330
No more end of life system.

00:24.550 --> 00:26.710
And the military won't 
be targeting us anymore.

00:26.890 --> 00:28.050
Hip hip hooray!

00:28.050 --> 00:29.040
Hip hip hooray!

00:29.040 --> 00:32.520
This is all thanks to Mitama-sama!

00:32.520 --> 00:33.890
Revere me!

00:32.520 --> 00:33.890
Hip hip hooray!

00:33.890 --> 00:35.230
Revere me!

00:33.890 --> 00:36.180
Hip hip hooray!

00:36.380 --> 00:37.630
Mitama-sama!

00:38.610 --> 00:39.520
Mitama-sama!

00:41.920 --> 00:44.480
Sis, we need more wine!

00:44.710 --> 00:46.210
They're so carefree.

00:46.210 --> 00:48.660
Even though our situation 
couldn't be worse.

00:50.390 --> 00:52.030
It's very much in line with this village.

00:52.540 --> 00:53.450
It's all good.

00:58.880 --> 01:00.790
What are you guys doing here, anyway?

01:01.360 --> 01:03.420
Don't worry.

01:04.170 --> 01:08.630
This is the last time we'll 
get to spend time with all of you.

01:09.690 --> 01:13.180
Just one last parting 
drink with my friends.

01:11.690 --> 01:13.180
Let's have some fun!

01:15.450 --> 01:16.820
Yeah!

01:15.960 --> 01:18.650
That doesn't sound like you.

01:20.890 --> 01:21.680
I guess.

01:22.130 --> 01:25.860
Yeah, I'm still not over 
Clen being a woman.

01:26.530 --> 01:29.660
And a pretty hot one, at that.

01:34.690 --> 01:35.930
You know,

01:36.530 --> 01:39.850
I didn't think you were so bad, either.

01:50.180 --> 01:52.090
Oh, I like how you moan.

01:53.780 --> 01:55.050
That's...

01:55.050 --> 01:56.160
Right here?

01:56.160 --> 01:57.880
You like that?

01:57.880 --> 02:00.480
Stop! If you keep doing that...

02:03.610 --> 02:05.130
This is so fun.

02:05.740 --> 02:09.280
As long as you're around, 
this village will be fine.

02:10.120 --> 02:14.530
And it seems like your preparations 
against the archons are done.

02:16.740 --> 02:19.110
Not even a reaction, huh?

02:19.520 --> 02:21.540
I tried provoking him,

02:21.540 --> 02:23.240
but that doesn't seem to work on Yukito.

02:23.490 --> 02:27.380
I'll blow up all of the 
archons with my powers!

02:27.850 --> 02:31.130
I'll show those fakes 
the power of a true god!

02:31.130 --> 02:32.840
You lost to Atar, though.

02:32.840 --> 02:36.430
W-W-Well, I just happened 
to have an off day,

02:36.430 --> 02:39.270
or rather, I let her win, is all!

02:39.270 --> 02:41.000
If I had gone all out, then—

02:41.000 --> 02:41.810
Well, then.

02:42.210 --> 02:44.180
It's time for me to go.

02:44.180 --> 02:45.420
If I take it too easy here,

02:45.420 --> 02:48.300
you or the others might 
get ahead of me.

02:48.300 --> 02:49.570
Oh, by the way,

02:50.050 --> 02:52.340
now that the capital's machines are gone,

02:52.340 --> 02:54.620
she can't use her powers.

02:54.620 --> 02:56.310
Do whatever you like with her.

02:58.780 --> 02:59.620
Loki.

03:00.250 --> 03:02.100
No matter what you are scheming,

03:02.100 --> 03:04.540
all I'll do is protect this village.

03:04.540 --> 03:06.630
And I will do whatever it takes.

03:08.150 --> 03:09.630
I'm looking forward to that.

03:10.120 --> 03:13.220
And I will do whatever 
it takes to become a god.

03:15.290 --> 03:19.310
Farewell, good friends.

03:20.050 --> 03:22.510
Thank you for all the fun 'til now.

03:24.890 --> 03:27.060
Get out of here already!

03:27.770 --> 03:29.150
Okay, okay.

03:30.930 --> 03:33.360
Your Highness...

03:35.850 --> 03:38.290
What should I do?

03:39.970 --> 03:41.760
Yukito-san showed us this food.

03:41.760 --> 03:43.960
It's called ice cream.

03:43.960 --> 03:45.250
If you eat something tasty,

03:45.250 --> 03:47.210
I'm sure you'll feel better soon.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.210
Wait.

03:49.890 --> 03:51.210
What is it?

03:51.380 --> 03:54.300
Yukito may be letting you go,

03:54.900 --> 03:56.670
but if you intend to bring 
harm to this village,

03:57.380 --> 03:59.420
I'll kill you right here.

03:59.960 --> 04:01.060
Hmm.

04:01.440 --> 04:04.410
I'm at a definite disadvantage 
in plain combat.

04:10.530 --> 04:12.520
I'm back to being a man?

04:12.520 --> 04:14.620
I no longer have to wear women's clothing,

04:14.620 --> 04:16.610
or be confused in the bathroom.

04:16.610 --> 04:18.140
Yes!

04:19.320 --> 04:21.370
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

04:29.050 --> 04:30.820
Unlike Atar,

04:30.820 --> 04:32.630
I can still use my powers.

04:33.840 --> 04:35.920
You can't kill me.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.970
Where are you going?

04:38.540 --> 04:39.800
To the imperial capital.

04:39.800 --> 04:41.150
The imperial capital?

04:41.150 --> 04:42.030
What for?

04:42.030 --> 04:43.010
Who knows?

04:43.890 --> 04:46.330
Wait! I'll go, too!

04:46.950 --> 04:47.640
What?

04:48.160 --> 04:51.370
The imperial capital is in chaos right now. 
I can't have you doing whatever you will!

04:51.370 --> 04:53.780
Protecting the people 
is my job as a knight!

04:56.770 --> 04:58.320
As you wish.

05:00.320 --> 05:01.970
Let's go to one more place!

05:01.970 --> 05:04.050
The boobs turned into muscles...

05:04.050 --> 05:05.400
Why?

05:05.400 --> 05:07.160
Just walk already.

05:07.160 --> 05:09.220
Yukito, can you do something please?

05:09.220 --> 05:11.630
I want to close down for the night.

05:11.630 --> 05:13.520
What do you want me to do?

05:12.470 --> 05:16.470
I still haven't shown you my true form.

05:16.470 --> 05:18.470
Believe me, Yukito.

05:18.780 --> 05:20.260
Why am I still alive?

05:20.570 --> 05:22.500
If this is my fate, I should just...

05:22.720 --> 05:26.320
That girl's basically 
like Mitama-chan, right?

05:26.320 --> 05:28.400
So she falls under your responsibility.

05:28.400 --> 05:29.120
What?

05:30.770 --> 05:32.770
Thanks.

05:36.130 --> 05:39.610
Why am I...

05:38.810 --> 05:39.610
Atar.

05:40.140 --> 05:41.640
You can wallow here all you want,

05:41.640 --> 05:44.160
but it won't revive the 
Emperor or the assembly.

05:45.010 --> 05:48.360
It's your fault for destroying everything!

05:49.280 --> 05:50.870
If we hadn't,

05:51.480 --> 05:53.950
we would have been killed.

06:01.300 --> 06:01.960
Don't cry.

06:02.490 --> 06:04.030
There's still hope.

06:05.190 --> 06:05.970
Huh?

06:05.970 --> 06:07.100
I will help you.

06:07.750 --> 06:10.270
Let's defeat all the other archons.

06:10.670 --> 06:13.480
Then you can rebuild the assembly.

06:15.150 --> 06:16.650
Judging from Loki's powers,

06:17.090 --> 06:19.410
the powers archons have are quite diverse.

06:19.410 --> 06:21.710
If you collected all the powers 
by vanquishing the archons,

06:21.710 --> 06:25.330
you'd have something close to omnipotence.

06:25.330 --> 06:29.460
You should be able to recreate the system 
with the Emperor and the assembly.

06:30.130 --> 06:33.420
Why are you helping me?

06:33.420 --> 06:36.590
For one, the other archons 
are my enemies, too.

06:37.420 --> 06:38.950
But, yeah, I wonder why.

06:38.950 --> 06:42.550
I guess I just can't ignore it 
when a girl like you is crying.

06:43.370 --> 06:44.680
Yukito...

06:45.330 --> 06:46.310
Atar...

06:48.200 --> 06:49.910
Here's to our alliance.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.220
Thank you.

06:55.910 --> 06:57.110
<i>They may be archons,</i>

06:57.490 --> 06:59.690
<i>but emotionally, 
they're no different than children.</i>

07:00.460 --> 07:03.450
<i>All the easier to manipulate.</i>

07:05.710 --> 07:07.200
Yukito.

07:09.850 --> 07:12.980
It's all melted, isn't it? 
Let's get you a new one.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.050
Want some?

07:26.690 --> 07:27.550
Yes.

07:31.170 --> 07:32.170
Here you go.

07:39.870 --> 07:40.820
Is it good?

07:44.470 --> 07:45.990
It's so good.

07:47.690 --> 07:50.650
So cute. Is it good?

07:51.180 --> 07:52.910
It's so good.

07:51.180 --> 07:55.410
Yukito-san... I knew it... He's a...

07:55.410 --> 07:58.040
It's good? I'm glad.

07:55.410 --> 08:00.090
lo-lo-lolicon!

07:56.810 --> 07:58.040
It's so good.

07:58.950 --> 08:00.090
Great.

08:01.380 --> 08:02.420
From this day on,

08:02.420 --> 08:05.050
our faith shall have two deities!

08:05.360 --> 08:06.750
Two deities?

08:06.750 --> 08:08.210
What does that mean?

08:08.430 --> 08:10.410
Meaning that from now on,

08:10.410 --> 08:13.180
Mitama and Atar are our two gods.

08:13.180 --> 08:14.550
What?!

08:14.550 --> 08:16.310
What is that supposed to mean, Yukito?!

08:14.550 --> 08:18.850
<b>Followers</b>

08:16.310 --> 08:18.450
How could you, when you have me?!

08:18.850 --> 08:19.770
<b>Followers</b>

08:19.770 --> 08:20.680
<b>Followers</b>

08:22.520 --> 08:26.610
<b>Followers</b>

08:22.520 --> 08:26.610
<b>Followers</b>

08:26.610 --> 08:28.410
I lost half of them!

08:28.410 --> 08:30.330
No, more than half!

08:30.920 --> 08:34.330
Atar, give it a shot.

08:35.940 --> 08:36.990
Sure.

08:51.180 --> 08:52.810
Wow!

08:53.260 --> 08:54.850
I could use my power.

08:56.210 --> 08:58.110
<i>As far as fighting goes,</i>

08:58.110 --> 09:00.230
<i>Atar is better than Mitama.</i>

09:00.560 --> 09:02.940
<i>With a soldier specialized in firepower,</i>

09:00.560 --> 09:02.940
Hey, don't get cocky now!

09:03.760 --> 09:05.850
<i>the number of viable strategies increases.</i>

09:22.850 --> 09:25.000
Somebody, help!

09:31.820 --> 09:33.510
Subjugation complete.

09:34.150 --> 09:36.210
Who are you?

09:36.210 --> 09:38.210
She just saved you, huh?

09:39.060 --> 09:45.310
Luckily we just happened to be 
having a barbecue party here!

09:47.210 --> 09:51.720
This is so good. The marbled Wagyu beef 
that Mitama-sama procured is incredible.

09:54.450 --> 09:58.850
Nothings beats drinking 
under a blue sky at noon!

09:58.850 --> 10:00.340
This ice cream is good.

10:00.340 --> 10:02.990
You'd best be grateful to me while you eat.

10:04.130 --> 10:06.450
Meat... Alcohol...

10:06.450 --> 10:09.810
For us isolation camp people, 
those are unattainable...

10:10.560 --> 10:16.010
In our village, meals 
like this are the norm.

10:16.740 --> 10:18.880
If you want, you could come check it out.

10:19.460 --> 10:22.510
Electric lights so you 
can do things at night.

10:23.060 --> 10:27.060
Faucets that provide clean water without 
the need to go to the well or the river.

10:27.550 --> 10:29.170
Here you go!

10:30.470 --> 10:34.360
Fancy meals that not even the 
people of the capital get to eat.

10:35.010 --> 10:38.840
We've got plenty of military power to 
protect our village from strange beasts.

10:39.410 --> 10:43.240
This is the "civilization" 
that our faith provides.

10:43.990 --> 10:47.850
And we can offer things 
like this to you as well.

10:47.850 --> 10:49.410
Under one condition.

10:51.040 --> 10:52.130
What condition?

10:52.320 --> 10:56.210
That your entire village reveres 
our Mitama-sama as a god,

10:56.640 --> 11:00.770
and comes under the umbrella of our faith.

11:00.770 --> 11:03.320
I am the one and only all-powerful,

11:03.320 --> 11:07.050
absolute strongest and best, 
the ultimate supreme god, Mitama.

11:07.910 --> 11:10.740
I offer blessings to my followers.

11:10.740 --> 11:11.880
Mitama-sama!

11:11.880 --> 11:13.440
The best and the strongest!

11:11.880 --> 11:13.440
Mitama-sama...

11:16.150 --> 11:18.860
<b>Followers</b>

11:16.530 --> 11:18.860
I've almost got 3,000 followers!

11:19.090 --> 11:22.020
We've managed to assimilate 
three isolation camps now.

11:22.020 --> 11:25.700
The tactic of taking over entire 
areas is proving to be efficient.

11:25.700 --> 11:30.910
And I mean, the meat and sweet things 
Mitama-chan gives out are really delicious.

11:31.130 --> 11:33.630
That's divine protection for ya!

11:34.860 --> 11:38.720
<i>Eventually, I intend to get a production 
system of livestock, salt, and sugar going</i>

11:38.720 --> 11:42.760
<i>so that we can produce all these things 
without depleting Mitama's powers.</i>

11:42.760 --> 11:46.080
<i>Tasty food is essentially addictive.</i>

11:46.080 --> 11:48.220
<i>Once you've tasted it, you can't go back.</i>

11:48.570 --> 11:50.470
Pathetic. It's just food.

11:50.470 --> 11:52.510
<i>Atar used to be like that, but now...</i>

11:52.510 --> 11:54.530
This ice cream is so good! It's so good!

11:53.780 --> 11:55.060
<i>She's like this!</i>

11:55.280 --> 11:58.220
Enjoying that ice cream I graced you with?

11:58.220 --> 12:00.340
Do you finally comprehend my greatness?

12:01.410 --> 12:03.840
Why do you have more followers than me?!

12:03.840 --> 12:06.420
Because I'm the one who 
defeated the strange beasts.

12:07.260 --> 12:08.790
You stinky thief!

12:09.010 --> 12:11.020
We're doing good on gaining followers.

12:10.810 --> 12:12.070
Give them back!

12:11.020 --> 12:14.150
Now we've got to gather more 
information on the other archons.

12:14.150 --> 12:17.000
And find Bertrand, 
who's completely disappeared.

12:17.000 --> 12:19.340
As I'm in charge of the 
investigations, allow me.

12:19.690 --> 12:22.290
I'm not sure where Ber-chan is right now,

12:22.290 --> 12:24.820
but there's one piece of 
concerning information.

12:24.820 --> 12:27.380
A woman named Dakini is 
calling herself a god

12:27.380 --> 12:30.800
and amassing a giant group 
on the scale of 10,000 followers.

12:30.800 --> 12:32.020
Ten thousand?!

12:32.020 --> 12:35.280
If she's calling herself a god when I exist

12:35.280 --> 12:37.570
that must mean she is just 
as clueless as this one here!

12:38.440 --> 12:40.190
Ow!

12:40.190 --> 12:43.560
Dakini is probably one of the archons.

12:40.810 --> 12:44.950
My finger! My finger...

12:43.560 --> 12:44.950
Do you know her, Atar?

12:45.270 --> 12:46.870
I don't know any details.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.850
Other than with our contact person, Loki,

12:48.850 --> 12:51.890
the archons barely ever had any 
interactions with each other.

12:51.890 --> 12:56.120
But I did hear that Dakini's 
powers are related to "love".

12:56.440 --> 12:57.470
Love.

12:57.470 --> 12:58.840
Love as in the emotion, I suppose.

12:59.450 --> 13:01.210
Archons are not like Mitama,

13:01.210 --> 13:02.690
so they are not actually gods.

13:02.690 --> 13:03.380
However...

13:03.710 --> 13:06.050
It doesn't matter what 
kind of archon she is.

13:06.050 --> 13:07.790
We just need to beat her 
and make her comply.

13:07.790 --> 13:10.680
I'll show her the strength of a true god!

13:10.680 --> 13:11.770
Hold it.

13:12.660 --> 13:13.310
Huh?

13:13.650 --> 13:15.560
There is a better way.

13:16.980 --> 13:19.770
A standard tactic when religious 
groups are competing for influence.

13:20.260 --> 13:23.190
You get in the middle and 
hijack it from the inside.

13:24.030 --> 13:27.030
We will infiltrate Dakini's group.

13:27.030 --> 13:30.550
What we need to watch out for 
is getting sucked into their group

13:30.550 --> 13:32.790
and becoming actual followers.

13:32.790 --> 13:35.860
Oh, you mean like switching sides, right?

13:35.860 --> 13:39.090
My love for Mitama-sama is limitless.

13:39.090 --> 13:40.340
Impossible.

13:40.340 --> 13:42.230
"It can't happen to me..."

13:42.230 --> 13:44.050
That sort of hubris is fatal.

13:44.220 --> 13:50.890
Any founder of a mid-sized group can convert 
any unprepared civilian with a 99% success rate.

13:50.890 --> 13:54.060
Do not underestimate the founders!

13:54.060 --> 13:55.450
Right...

13:56.650 --> 14:00.000
The most effective way to not get 
seduced by this other group is to

14:00.000 --> 14:01.560
arm yourself with knowledge.

14:02.230 --> 14:04.970
Teacher, what sort of knowledge?

14:04.970 --> 14:08.070
Based on information 
from the land I'm from,

14:08.320 --> 14:09.760
I mean, I am capable of learning,

14:08.320 --> 14:13.240
it seems the Dakini's faith has a doctrine 
centered around the emotion of love.

14:09.760 --> 14:12.350
but I think Roy has no chance.

14:12.350 --> 14:13.910
What now?!

14:13.240 --> 14:13.910
In short,

14:15.390 --> 14:16.660
it's sex.

14:18.870 --> 14:21.750
Sex?!

14:22.130 --> 14:26.350
I didn't expect Sil to bow out like that.

14:28.540 --> 14:32.970
Actually, my sister's not so good at 
dealing with that stuff head-on like that.

14:32.970 --> 14:36.530
Even though she's totally fine 
with dirty jokes and stuff.

14:36.530 --> 14:39.180
I guess as far as the 
people of this world go,

14:36.530 --> 14:39.180
The sex lesson was so fun, huh?

14:39.180 --> 14:40.650
It was so deep.

14:39.180 --> 14:43.110
Sil is normal, and these 
two are overly lustful?

14:40.650 --> 14:43.110
Yeah, I really learned a lot.

14:44.470 --> 14:47.850
So this is the Dakini 
faith's building, huh?

14:49.410 --> 14:50.830
Is this a love hotel or what?

14:52.000 --> 14:56.160
I did a 72 hour session with a group of 12,

14:56.160 --> 14:57.750
and it was, like, so crazy!

14:57.750 --> 14:59.980
I mean, quality over quantity, right?

14:59.980 --> 15:04.210
So I thought of this move called 
nonuple penetration revolver.

15:04.210 --> 15:06.340
So funny! For real?

15:04.770 --> 15:06.340
What is it with them?

15:06.510 --> 15:09.970
Excuse me. Is this Dakini-sama's 
religious group?

15:07.040 --> 15:08.670
That's crazy.

15:09.970 --> 15:11.240
Oh, yeah it is.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.470
You wanting to join or what?

15:12.470 --> 15:14.930
Ah, yes that's right.

15:15.510 --> 15:19.140
Then I will take them to the 
Gohonzon-sama from here.

15:19.140 --> 15:20.520
Riche-sama?

15:20.520 --> 15:22.000
My name is Riche.

15:22.000 --> 15:25.270
I am the deputy head of the third branch 
of Dakini's House of Holy Love.

15:25.570 --> 15:27.690
This place is huge.

15:28.080 --> 15:31.910
You guys ought to present me 
with a facility this big, too!

15:30.700 --> 15:31.910
It's Riche-sama.

15:32.140 --> 15:35.280
She must have finished 100 
couplings again today.

15:35.280 --> 15:37.250
She's really the number one slut here!

15:37.250 --> 15:39.560
I heard she can make people 
climax just by looking at them.

15:39.560 --> 15:42.370
She wears those glasses 
to contain that power!

15:42.720 --> 15:45.090
Riche-sama, I have a question if I may!

15:45.660 --> 15:46.920
Speak.

15:47.260 --> 15:51.010
Our faith's teachings will surely save you.

15:51.010 --> 15:55.980
I would like to undergo the trial of tentacles
 that Gohonzon-sama spoke of,

15:55.980 --> 15:58.900
but I can't find any tentacles anywhere!

15:59.930 --> 16:01.390
No need to worry.

16:01.830 --> 16:03.840
If you think of it as a tentacle,

16:03.840 --> 16:06.450
then it will be a tentacle.

16:06.450 --> 16:08.820
If I think... of it as?

16:08.820 --> 16:12.930
Yes. Hands, legs, fingers, and tongues...

16:12.930 --> 16:16.620
Even this world's wind and 
land are like tentacles.

16:16.620 --> 16:20.910
See? Isn't the entire world 
teeming with writhing tentacles?

16:21.530 --> 16:23.750
Thank you so much, Riche-sama!

16:23.920 --> 16:25.790
<i>Seriously, what's wrong with them?</i>

16:25.790 --> 16:27.860
Riche-sama is so amazing!

16:26.920 --> 16:28.720
Just her words make me sopping wet!

16:28.720 --> 16:31.840
I knew that legend of her sleeping with 
1,000 people in one night was true!

16:32.080 --> 16:34.970
She wears those glasses 
to contain that power!

16:35.950 --> 16:38.100
That resonated with me.

16:38.100 --> 16:39.390
What a lesson.

16:39.390 --> 16:41.420
I was moved as well.

16:41.420 --> 16:42.980
Seriously?

16:44.100 --> 16:48.540
This is the ceremony room where 
Gohonzon-sama will see you.

16:53.370 --> 16:58.770
New members are only able to meet 
Gohonzon-sama as a pair of a man and a woman.

16:58.770 --> 17:00.540
I will take you to another room.

17:00.540 --> 17:01.830
Yukito!

17:01.830 --> 17:03.460
Will you be okay without me?

17:03.460 --> 17:04.340
I'm worried!

17:04.340 --> 17:05.540
Just go already.

17:05.540 --> 17:07.330
Yukito!

17:07.330 --> 17:09.510
Then please wait for a moment.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.760
Yukito!

17:14.100 --> 17:16.970
It looks like we'll be able 
to get in quite easily.

17:16.970 --> 17:18.210
Don't let your guard down.

17:18.210 --> 17:22.010
According to the Womb Realm Mandala 
or the Mahāvairocana-sūtra,

17:22.010 --> 17:23.810
Dakini is a fierce god 
with powerful magic power,

17:23.810 --> 17:25.780
or gods of death who eat humans.

17:25.780 --> 17:28.890
Though the archon Dakini will be 
different from the god Dakini,

17:28.890 --> 17:30.610
we don't know anything about them.

17:30.910 --> 17:33.110
So they might be a scary person.

17:33.410 --> 17:36.230
How bad is it going to be...?

17:37.870 --> 17:41.370
'Sup?! Sorry for the wait!

17:41.950 --> 17:44.200
I'm Dakini!

17:44.450 --> 17:47.460
So, like, I've been gaining 
mad followers lately,

17:47.460 --> 17:49.210
so I'm so busy?

17:49.490 --> 17:52.520
I only slept two hours, 
so I'm, like, so tired.

17:52.520 --> 17:55.030
Ten thousand followers. 
You know, ten <i>thousand.</i>

17:55.030 --> 17:57.680
But I still come to meet all the new peeps.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.200
Isn't that so good of me?

17:59.200 --> 18:00.500
<i>So gaudy!</i>

18:00.500 --> 18:02.720
<i>Who is this gaudy person?</i>

18:02.720 --> 18:04.380
<i>Could this really be an archon?</i>

18:05.740 --> 18:08.280
We're from a nearby isolation camp.

18:08.280 --> 18:11.560
We humbly request to be accepted 
into your religious group.

18:11.780 --> 18:12.930
Okay.

18:12.930 --> 18:14.550
<i>So easy!</i>

18:14.550 --> 18:17.450
What's important to our group is

18:17.750 --> 18:19.760
"doing things the way you like."

18:19.760 --> 18:20.830
Seriously, that's all!

18:20.830 --> 18:21.740
Easy, right?

18:22.960 --> 18:27.310
Living according to your desires is the 
most natural thing for humans anyway!

18:27.710 --> 18:30.710
Well, I got to see the 
new peeps' cute faces,

18:30.710 --> 18:31.920
so up I go.

18:32.340 --> 18:35.090
I'll leave the rest to my underlings.

18:35.520 --> 18:36.660
See ya!

18:37.380 --> 18:40.180
I wasn't expecting that type of person.

18:44.800 --> 18:47.530
<i>What the...? My body feels so hot!</i>

18:51.890 --> 18:53.410
Yukito-san.

18:56.050 --> 18:56.900
Al?

18:57.100 --> 18:59.150
There's something wrong with me...

19:00.290 --> 19:00.950
What's wrong?!

19:01.560 --> 19:04.120
Let's have intercourse, Yukito-san!

19:04.970 --> 19:07.130
According to the teachings of Dakini-sama,

19:07.130 --> 19:09.560
that's our duty as followers!

19:09.560 --> 19:12.040
<i>She's already been taken over?!</i>

19:12.600 --> 19:15.000
It's erection time!

19:16.280 --> 19:18.840
<i>We haven't consumed anything 
since we got here,</i>

19:18.840 --> 19:20.270
<i>and there's no suspicious smell either.</i>

19:20.270 --> 19:21.680
<i>I doubt it's an aphrodisiac.</i>

19:21.680 --> 19:25.140
<i>Then this is Dakini's power?!</i>

19:27.870 --> 19:29.670
Yukito-san.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.940
Let's do it.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.360
<i>Crap...</i>

19:37.970 --> 19:39.150
<i>I can't...</i>

19:39.150 --> 19:41.110
<i>think anymore...</i>

19:41.110 --> 19:42.160
<i>No!</i>

19:42.160 --> 19:43.490
<i>I won't give in!</i>

19:43.490 --> 19:44.520
Snap out of it!

19:44.520 --> 19:45.450
Come to your senses!

19:52.470 --> 19:53.120
Ow.

19:54.620 --> 19:56.630
What just happened?

19:56.940 --> 20:00.980
Kill, annihilate, execute...

20:00.980 --> 20:04.600
I'll make you regret you were ever born!

20:04.600 --> 20:05.600
Mitama?!

20:05.600 --> 20:07.240
Yukito!

20:07.240 --> 20:08.220
What happened?

20:08.220 --> 20:12.140
This perverted trash human 
tried to defile me!

20:12.140 --> 20:14.700
My heart has suffered a grievous wound!

20:14.700 --> 20:17.090
If you became my follower,

20:17.090 --> 20:19.760
this wound would be healed...

20:19.760 --> 20:20.770
Leaving that aside,

20:20.770 --> 20:22.150
what happened?

20:22.150 --> 20:22.610
Damn.

20:23.490 --> 20:25.130
When we were alone in the room,

20:25.130 --> 20:27.620
he suddenly jumped on me!

20:27.910 --> 20:29.800
Mitama-sama denied me,

20:29.800 --> 20:32.740
the girls from the village say I'm gross...

20:32.740 --> 20:34.670
Yukito, why only you? It's not fair!

20:34.920 --> 20:36.920
Damn it!

20:35.610 --> 20:36.920
What?

20:37.510 --> 20:40.800
And what are we going to 
do with this destroyed room?

20:40.800 --> 20:42.130
Oh, Riche-tan.

20:42.700 --> 20:43.860
Gohonzon-sama.

20:43.860 --> 20:45.300
Heya.

20:45.650 --> 20:49.170
The secret ritual for joining is done.

20:49.170 --> 20:50.790
Understood.

20:50.790 --> 20:54.520
Please leave the rest to this 
faithful servant of yours.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.960
Cool, cool.

20:55.960 --> 20:59.140
I set the new people's 
love to berserk mode,

20:59.140 --> 21:00.730
so be careful.

21:02.030 --> 21:05.310
As you wish.

21:08.740 --> 21:10.550
All misfortunes,

21:10.550 --> 21:12.160
be cleansed!

21:12.610 --> 21:15.580
Thus it shall be!

21:15.960 --> 21:18.030
What are you doing?!

21:24.170 --> 21:25.200
You saw that?

21:25.200 --> 21:27.090
Never speak of what happened here

21:27.090 --> 21:30.940
or about the girl's powers.

21:30.940 --> 21:32.600
If you ever say anything...

21:32.980 --> 21:34.180
Then, what?

21:40.480 --> 21:43.110
Then I'll have to make your 
body unable to resist me!

21:44.060 --> 21:46.530
I won't give in to pressure!

21:46.930 --> 21:48.540
You're tough, huh?

21:53.720 --> 21:54.830
What are you doing?!

21:55.830 --> 21:57.580
I wonder how long you'll stay defiant.

21:58.010 --> 21:59.330
Without your glasses,

21:59.330 --> 22:02.660
you're also just a normal woman!

22:05.290 --> 22:06.670
It's non-consensual, but still!

22:06.670 --> 22:08.050
It's non-consensual, but still!

22:08.220 --> 22:09.840
It's non-consensual, but still!

22:10.250 --> 22:13.580
It feels so good!

22:16.800 --> 22:17.950
Huh?

22:21.610 --> 22:23.510
What's wrong with her?

22:26.200 --> 22:28.450
So, what do we do with you?

22:31.970 --> 22:33.380
Defiled...

22:33.380 --> 22:36.620
I've been defiled!

22:36.820 --> 22:38.240
Uh huh...?

22:38.240 --> 22:42.540
Now you know I'm a lady of the 
bed who's never had a session.

22:42.980 --> 22:44.990
A lady of the bed who's never had a session?

22:44.990 --> 22:46.610
Despite being in this group?

22:46.610 --> 22:47.550
Yukito-san.

22:48.210 --> 22:51.840
What were you doing while I was passed out?

22:52.050 --> 22:53.500
I didn't do anything!

22:53.500 --> 22:57.540
I don't know why, but this woman randomly 
orgasmed on her own and passed out!

22:58.130 --> 23:00.040
Who are you people?

23:00.040 --> 23:02.950
It doesn't look like Gohonzon-sama's 
powers worked on you.

23:02.950 --> 23:04.990
It's not that they didn't work.

23:04.990 --> 23:06.570
It's quite embarrassing.

23:06.570 --> 23:11.570
I'm resistant to these kinds of things because 
of the training I was forced to endure by my father.

23:11.570 --> 23:15.430
Oh, and this one's got a special condition, 
so Dakini's powers don't work.

23:15.430 --> 23:16.620
It's because I'm a god!

23:16.830 --> 23:17.540
God?

23:17.890 --> 23:22.390
I see. So you also call yourself 
god, like Gohonzon-sama.

23:22.720 --> 23:23.640
Well, then...

23:25.210 --> 23:27.050
Please help me!

23:28.690 --> 23:29.940
Say what?

23:31.190 --> 23:34.410
Please help me destroy 
this religious group!

